{
  "slug": "productivity",
  "name": "Productivity",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Manage tasks, plan your day, and build up memory of important context about your work. Syncs with your calendar, email, and chat to keep everything organized and on track.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills** and **9 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `memory-management` (Two-tier memory system that makes Claude a true workplace collaborator), `start` (Initialize the productivity system and open the dashboard), `task-management` (Simple task management using a shared TASKS.md file), `update` (Sync tasks and refresh memory from your current activity)\n- **MCP servers** (9): `slack`, `notion`, `asana`, `linear`, `atlassian`, `monday`, `clickup`, `google calendar`, and 1 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install productivity@knowledge-work-plugins` from `anthropics/knowledge-work-plugins` (`productivity`).",
